{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296920/extras/Description_Header_ShortGame.png?t=1740604821\" />Our intrepid, ingenious crafter and explorer Flibbius  has always dreamt of taking to the sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you use your wits, problem solving and creativity to help him find the Mysterious Flying Machine and finally make Flibbius' dreams come true?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296920/extras/Page_Gif_Wally.gif?t=1740604821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296920/extras/Description_Header_Features.png?t=1740604821\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short, delightful, adventure featuring our tortoisey protagonist Flibbius</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet a variety of wacky, wonderful and quirky characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A charming world to explore with puzzles and adorable graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Works fantastically on steamdeck!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296920/extras/Description_Header_Community.png?t=1740604821\" />Please join our discord channel if you want to keep up to date with our progress or ask us any questions! or follow our journey on any of our other social channels - Your support means the world to a tiny indie team like ours.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3296920?t=1740604821","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3296920?t=1740604821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_